  case                                           with |     with +    
  normal enum                                    COMPILES   COMPILES  
  kimi (6,3): TRIPLE enum alias                  COMPILES   REFUSED   

  arithmetic: the alias drags THREE pairs together and NBITS collapses 9 -> 6.
    with |  -> OR  = 0x3f            RHS = (1<<6)-1 = 0x3f   EQUAL  -> escapes
    with +  -> SUM = 1+2+4+8+16+32+8+16+32 = 119   RHS = 63          -> caught

TRIPLE_DONE
